{"id":"e3545f8c2a4ed307","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-tqbf.md","title":"True Quantified Boolean Formulas","display":"df-tqbf — True Quantified Boolean Formulas","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-formula]]","[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]"],"display":"df-tqbf — True Quantified Boolean Formulas","label":"28-df-tqbf","aliases":["28-df-tqbf"],"type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b830febc662345bf\" href=\"?note=b830febc662345bf\" title=\"28-df-boolean-formula\">28-df-boolean-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tqbf — True Quantified Boolean Formulas"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-tqbf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-tqbf</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFml}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{PropVar}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b830febc662345bf\" href=\"?note=b830febc662345bf\" title=\"28-df-boolean-formula\">28-df-boolean-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a>。</li>\n<li>下文以标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"4,5\">\\(4,5\\)</span> 引入量词语法构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\,\\psi\">\\(\\exists x\\,\\psi\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,\\psi\">\\(\\forall x\\,\\psi\\)</span>，与布尔语法标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,2,3\">\\(0,1,2,3\\)</span> 区分；递归按有限语法树高度进行。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\\)</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha[b/x]\">\\(\\alpha[b/x]\\)</span> 为把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的值更新成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 的赋值，正式定义如下。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_0\">\\(\\alpha_0\\)</span> 是任一固定总赋值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm Q}:\\mathrm{QBF}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm Q}:\\mathrm{QBF}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 是固定单射，源表示是显式前缀量词序列、二进制变量索引和带连接词标签的布尔语法树。编码、逆解码、值域检查均为多项式时间；码长与上述有限表和语法树的总位长彼此多项式有界。该编码作为固定结构参数。</li>\n<li>下文引入闭公式集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedQBF}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedQBF}\\)</span>、递归求值族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha}\">\\(\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha}\\)</span> 与语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TQBF}\">\\(\\mathrm{TQBF}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\,\\psi\\coloneqq\\langle4,x,\\psi\\rangle,\\qquad\\forall x\\,\\psi\\coloneqq\\langle5,x,\\psi\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists x\\,\\psi\\coloneqq\\langle4,x,\\psi\\rangle,\\qquad\\forall x\\,\\psi\\coloneqq\\langle5,x,\\psi\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QBF}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}F_n,\\qquad\nF_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\qquad\nF_{n+1}\\coloneqq F_n\\cup\\{\\exists x\\,\\psi,\\forall x\\,\\psi\\mid x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\\land\\psi\\in F_n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{QBF}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}F_n,\\qquad\nF_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\qquad\nF_{n+1}\\coloneqq F_n\\cup\\{\\exists x\\,\\psi,\\forall x\\,\\psi\\mid x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\\land\\psi\\in F_n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\alpha[b/x](y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}b,&amp;y=x,\\\\\\alpha(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathrm Q}(\\phi)&amp;\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}(\\phi),&amp;\\phi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathrm Q}(\\psi)\\setminus\\{x\\},&amp;\\phi=\\exists x\\,\\psi\\lor\\phi=\\forall x\\,\\psi,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{ClosedQBF}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathrm{QBF}\\mid\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathrm Q}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha}(\\phi)&amp;\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}(\\phi),&amp;\\phi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\\\\n\\max_{b\\in\\{0,1\\}}\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha[b/x]}(\\psi),&amp;\\phi=\\exists x\\,\\psi,\\\\\n\\min_{b\\in\\{0,1\\}}\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha[b/x]}(\\psi),&amp;\\phi=\\forall x\\,\\psi,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{TQBF}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm Q}(\\phi)\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathrm{ClosedQBF}\\land\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha_0}(\\phi)=1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\alpha[b/x](y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}b,&amp;y=x,\\\\\\alpha(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathrm Q}(\\phi)&amp;\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}(\\phi),&amp;\\phi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathrm Q}(\\psi)\\setminus\\{x\\},&amp;\\phi=\\exists x\\,\\psi\\lor\\phi=\\forall x\\,\\psi,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{ClosedQBF}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathrm{QBF}\\mid\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathrm Q}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha}(\\phi)&amp;\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}(\\phi),&amp;\\phi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\\\\n\\max_{b\\in\\{0,1\\}}\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha[b/x]}(\\psi),&amp;\\phi=\\exists x\\,\\psi,\\\\\n\\min_{b\\in\\{0,1\\}}\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha[b/x]}(\\psi),&amp;\\phi=\\forall x\\,\\psi,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{TQBF}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm Q}(\\phi)\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathrm{ClosedQBF}\\land\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha_0}(\\phi)=1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此处 QBF 是布尔矩阵外加有限量词前缀的语法，与原书定义4.10一致。闭公式的递归值只依赖自由变量上的初始赋值，故对闭公式与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_0\">\\(\\alpha_0\\)</span> 无关；这可按前缀长度归纳。量词更新按变量名字绑定，允许遮蔽；若要搬移量词或合并前缀，可先改名避免捕获。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定义4.10、例4.11–4.12；印刷83–84页；PDF109–110页。语法和真值已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-formula","status":"resolved","id":"b830febc662345bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"2eb3efc252f058f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-formula","status":"resolved","id":"b830febc662345bf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoolFml}$、$\\mathrm{PropVar}$、$\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}$ 和 $\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-formula]]、[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"2eb3efc252f058f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoolFml}$、$\\mathrm{PropVar}$、$\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}$ 和 $\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-formula]]、[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFml}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PropVar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"4,5","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x\\,\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\,\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"0,1,2,3","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha[b/x]","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm Q}:\\mathrm{QBF}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedQBF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TQBF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x\\,\\psi\\coloneqq\\langle4,x,\\psi\\rangle,\\qquad\\forall x\\,\\psi\\coloneqq\\langle5,x,\\psi\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QBF}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}F_n,\\qquad\nF_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\qquad\nF_{n+1}\\coloneqq F_n\\cup\\{\\exists x\\,\\psi,\\forall x\\,\\psi\\mid x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\\land\\psi\\in F_n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\alpha[b/x](y)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}b,&y=x,\\\\\\alpha(y),&y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathrm Q}(\\phi)&\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}(\\phi),&\\phi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathrm Q}(\\psi)\\setminus\\{x\\},&\\phi=\\exists x\\,\\psi\\lor\\phi=\\forall x\\,\\psi,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{ClosedQBF}&\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathrm{QBF}\\mid\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathrm Q}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha}(\\phi)&\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}(\\phi),&\\phi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\\\\n\\max_{b\\in\\{0,1\\}}\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha[b/x]}(\\psi),&\\phi=\\exists x\\,\\psi,\\\\\n\\min_{b\\in\\{0,1\\}}\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha[b/x]}(\\psi),&\\phi=\\forall x\\,\\psi,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{TQBF}&\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm Q}(\\phi)\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathrm{ClosedQBF}\\land\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha_0}(\\phi)=1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha_0","display":false}],"bytes":3010,"backlinks":[{"id":"91bfe52ee99ebd32","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\mathrm{QBF}$、$\\mathrm{ClosedQBF}$、$\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha_0}$、标准有效前缀语法编码 $\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm Q}$ 见 [[28-df-tqbf]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"空间完全问题：[[28-df-path]]、[[28-thm-path-nl-complete]]、[[28-df-tqbf]]、[[28-thm-tqbf-pspace-complete]]。"},{"id":"13847817d539efaf","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e4bbd2ac00e2ea21","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ed20d679e3199320","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["b830febc662345bf","2eb3efc252f058f9"]}